WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.780
*Far, far away, in a giant hole in the earth...*

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.800
*Our three hilariously funny, heroic, sore-lost champions arrive.*

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:08.340
*Markiplier, the god of games.*

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:08.860
*Bob, overlord friend of Markiplier.*

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:09.680
*Wade, the heroic badass sore loser.*

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:12.580
*But then, their archenemy, the villain behind this destruction, appears before them.*

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:15.760
*Barbara, the evil being from UNO.*

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.820
*Our three heroes against this madman receive their weapons.*
Bob: Oohhh, nice! Nice!

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:24.680
Bob: Ooh!

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:25.640
Mark: Ahh!

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:26.780
Wade: Ooooh!

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:31.400
*Bob equips the golden valentine sword.*
Bob: Alright come on now. That-- oh! that's good. Ah, there's a good one.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.900
*Wade equips a pink useless slingshot stick.*
Wade: Fucking goddamnit what is this sh-- I don't want it take it back!

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:35.919
Bob: *snickers* That's uh...

00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:40.800
*Markiplier equips the sword of not-so-proportional color.*
Mark: Aw that's not a good color. I don't like that color. Ah it's alright.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:42.460
Mark: Haiya!

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:44.900
Bob: What's uh- what's Bar- what's Barb got over there?

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:48.180
*In a ferocious strike of lighting, Barbara reveals her terrifying pure gold duo tomahawks.*

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:50.160
Mark: Well, this-- well, well.

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:54.360
Bob: *inhales*

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:59.140
Bob: Uh no, that's fine, that's fine, yeah that's fine, that's fine.
Mark: I'll get 'em! Get 'em! I'll get 'em!

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:00.120
Mark: Okay.

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:01.120
Mark: Wade get her!

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:04.220
Wade: As if you actually-- you would not want me to get her!

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:08.080
*unintelligible arguing*

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.300
Beheaded Wade: NooOOO! MY HEAD!

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:14.212
Bob: Good God!

00:01:14.212 --> 00:01:15.740
Headless Wade: I don't want that!
Mark: *chuckles*

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:19.520
Mark: What a noble sacrifice you made Bob, I'm really proud of you.
(HE'S WADE YOU SHTOOPID BISSHSHHH)

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:23.360
Bob: I did this for my friend! I did this for you!?
Mark: I'm really proud of you.
Wade: Don't you dare waste them!

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:25.420
Mark: I'm so proud of you.

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:30.760
Wade: Barbara said, "How sweet, I love the way the light shines off the top of your head!"

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:33.740
Wade: That's what Barbara said to ME!

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:36.340
Wade: Fuck you Barbara, take this goddamn bullshit.

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:40.840
*Wade's attempt to attack Barbara with the slingshot stick becomes unsuccessful, as the stick itself snaps in half.*

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:43.220
Bob: Oooh look at that, tough one tough one.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:46.040
*Bob knows what he must do.*
Bob: *deep breath* I think I guess I'm gonna have to draw...

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.300
*Markiplier joins Bob.*
Mark: I got you Bob

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:54.000
*Barbara launches one of the golden tomahawks at the both of them.*

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:55.060
*the attempted attack is unsuccessful.*

00:01:58.140 --> 00:01:59.280
Wade the armless: OH GOD!

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:06.020
Mark: Awwww...

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:08.440
Mark: Aww man!

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:15.280
Bob: *inhales* Good play Barb.

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:17.460
Wade: Well, what a play!

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:19.940
Bob: Here Wade, we'll have you try, you try, you try.

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:22.300
Mark: You try it!
Bob: Come on, fight her off. Yeah, that's the spirit.

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:29.640
Wade: Oh what a b-- Oh THANK YOU! THANK YOU BARBARUHH!

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:32.180
Bob: Nice play!
Mark: Nice Barbara, nice!

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:34.860
Bob: Good shit. Wow.
Mark: Wow.

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:36.540
Wade: I'm just gonna FUCKING CRAWL!

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.360
Bob: Hahahahaha

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:41.660
Mark: Wade? Wade?

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:45.980
Wade: What the fuck do you want? Oh Barbara don't you dare, dehh- don't you dare!

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:52.000
Wade: No Barbara, no!

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:55.380
Mark&amp;Bob: *laughs*

00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:59.440
Mark: Oookay!

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:04.840
Mark: Good move! I-- not for me though.

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:06.260
Bob: I don't think Wade's doing very well.

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:08.560
Wade: Yeah do you want jump in again? Son of a brrr-- Goddamnit!

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:10.300
Wade: Uh-oh.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:15.640
*a rather large explosion ensues as Wade gets crushed underneath the giant black weapon.*

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:19.880
Bob: Calm down.
Wade: I'm fine. How are you?

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:24.680
Bob: Deep breaths. I- I feel like you just need to take a breath for a little bit and relax, it's fine.

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:28.560
Bob: Everything's going- everything's going so well...
Wade: I'm breathing! I'm breathing very happily--

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.520
Wade: GODDAMNIT!

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:33.080
Bob: *laughing uncontrollably*

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:35.100
Wade: My motherfucking hand!

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:36.480
*Wade becomes enraged at the loss of his apendage.*
Angry Wade: B A R B A R A!

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:38.160
Bob: Ayyy look at that!

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:39.440
Wade: FUCK YOU BARBARA!

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:42.160
Wade: *crazed laughter*

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:43.680
Mark: There you go! Yeah yeah yeah!

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:45.100
*boing*

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:48.080
*Wade furiously attempts to violently slay the demented Barbara.*

00:03:53.280 --> 00:04:00.580
*But then, Barbara swings the tomahawk at Wade. What will happen next? To be continued on the next episode of The Legend Of Barbara!*

